  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5 * 2 = 35\n\n4 * 3 = 28\n\n5 × (5 + 2) = 5 × 7 = 35\n\n4 × (4 + 3) = 4 × 7 = 28\n\n**Rule:** a * b = a × (a + b)\n\nNow,\n\n6 * 4 = 6 × (6 + 4)\n\n= 6 × 10\n\n= **60**\n\nHence, the correct option is **Option 4**",
